OL,3,GNEWSAM8 westbound closed near
OL,4,ALivingston after bus bursts into flames
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M8 westbound is closed after a bus
OL,7,Fburst into flames during rush hour, the
OL,8,FScottish Fire Service (SFRS) has said.
OL,10,FThe busy motorway is closed between
OL,11,Fjunction two and junction three after
OL,12,Fthe fire was reported at about 16:55.
OL,13,FTwo fire engines are at the scene.
OL,15,FFootage shows large flames engulfing
OL,16,Fthe vehicle and there are reports of
OL,17,Flong queues going back to Hermiston
OL,18,FGait in Edinburgh.
OL,20,FPolice Scotland said there were no
OL,21,Freports of injuries and urged drivers
OL,22,Fto use an alternative route.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
